{"4223540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doodle Wipeout", "steam_appid": 4223540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doodle Wipeout</strong> is a fast-paced, action roguelite which subverts the classic survivor genre where you hunt the enemies as they look to avoid you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a tiny eraser fighting against waves of chaotic enemies - a doodle army - that has invaded the notebook canvas. But you don't eliminate them with weapons - but erase them by scrubbing them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras/cc42cdbad75d8307df62fdb2f2d6f1d8.poster.avif?t=1773975367\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras/cc42cdbad75d8307df62fdb2f2d6f1d8.webm?t=1773975367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras/cc42cdbad75d8307df62fdb2f2d6f1d8.mp4?t=1773975367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as an eraser your health is your ammunition. Every time you wipeout a doodle - you shrink and deplete your life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You not only have to manage your own health, but also manage the canvas integrity, which falls as the doodles invade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras/3759dfb33125aacd755f77756fdc1cac.poster.avif?t=1773975367\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras/3759dfb33125aacd755f77756fdc1cac.webm?t=1773975367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras/3759dfb33125aacd755f77756fdc1cac.mp4?t=1773975367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you onto a fresh canvas - and it's your job to clean it, one eraser stroke at a time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erase instead of shoot: </strong>You are not fighting with guns, bombs or knives. But you are just an eraser gliding across the page, erasing doodle creatures one swipe at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite progression:</strong> Unlock upgrades and combos across runs. Each try is different, but every erased doodle brings you closer to success.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras/7d4cfd61876cb927fdf813393988f3aa.avif?t=1773975367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4223540/extras_big/7d4cfd61876cb927fdf813393988f3aa.webp?t=1773975367 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live sketch chaos:</strong> Enemy doodles move, swarm, and spread across the page. You not only have to survive waves of doodles but also clean the page to save the canvas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short play sessions, big fun:</strong> With quick runs and escalating difficulty, Eraser Game is perfect both for spontaneous play and deeper replay sessions. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you successfully wipe out waves of sketchy troublemakers before the canvas is lost?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s